{"title":"Career Roadmap · Sustainable Interior Consultant","role":"Sustainable Interior Consultant","summary":"A Sustainable Interior Consultant helps design and transform interior spaces with a focus on energy efficiency, healthy materials, indoor environmental quality, resource efficiency, circularity and occupant wellbeing.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Arch (Bachelor of Architecture)","Course":"Interior Architecture & Design"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Sustainable Interior Consultant helps design and transform interior spaces with a focus on energy efficiency, healthy materials, indoor environmental quality, resource efficiency, circularity and occupant wellbeing."},{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Arch graduate, this is a natural specialization because the role combines architectural knowledge with interior design and building-performance principles."},{"type":"p","text":"The consultant may work on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sustainable material selection"},{"text":"Low-VOC and healthy finishes"},{"text":"Energy-efficient lighting"},{"text":"Indoor air quality"},{"text":"Thermal and visual comfort"},{"text":"Acoustic performance"},{"text":"Water-efficient fixtures"},{"text":"Furniture and product selection"},{"text":"Recycled and renewable materials"},{"text":"Waste reduction"},{"text":"Adaptive reuse"},{"text":"Circular interior design"},{"text":"Green-building certification support"},{"text":"The role is broader than simply selecting \"eco-friendly materials.\" A strong consultant evaluates the whole interior system."}]},{"type":"flow","items":["Building","Interior Architecture","Materials + Furniture","Lighting + HVAC","Indoor Environmental Quality","Energy + Water + Waste","Occupant Health & Comfort","Sustainable Interior"]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizon","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Architecture + environmental fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Interior design + materials"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Sustainable interiors + building performance"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Advanced projects + professional internship"}],[{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Junior Interior / Sustainability Consultant"}],[{"text":"2–5 years"},{"text":"Sustainable Interior Consultant"}],[{"text":"5–8 years"},{"text":"Senior Sustainability / Interior Consultant"}],[{"text":"8+ years"},{"text":"Sustainability Lead / Design Consultant"}]]}]},{"heading":"Year-Wise Roadmap","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Architecture & Environmental Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong fundamentals in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Architectural design"},{"text":"Building construction"},{"text":"Materials"},{"text":"Environmental studies"},{"text":"Climate"},{"text":"Lighting fundamentals"},{"text":"Building services"},{"text":"Human comfort"},{"text":"Architectural graphics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Start learning"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Thermal comfort"},{"text":"Daylight"},{"text":"Natural ventilation"},{"text":"Solar radiation"},{"text":"Energy consumption"},{"text":"Indoor air quality"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Software"},{"type":"p","text":"Start with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AutoCAD"},{"text":"SketchUp"},{"text":"Photoshop"},{"text":"Illustrator"},{"text":"Revit basics"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 2 — Interior Architecture","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop strong interior-design fundamentals."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Space planning"},{"text":"Ergonomics"},{"text":"Furniture planning"},{"text":"Interior detailing"},{"text":"Materials"},{"text":"Finishes"},{"text":"Lighting"},{"text":"Acoustics"},{"text":"Ceiling systems"},{"text":"Flooring"},{"text":"Joinery"},{"text":"Building services"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Understand the interior system"},{"type":"flow","items":["Space Planning","Materials","Lighting","HVAC","Acoustics","Furniture","Occupant Comfort"]},{"type":"p","text":"At this stage, learn to evaluate materials not only by appearance and cost, but also by:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Durability"},{"text":"Maintenance"},{"text":"Embodied carbon"},{"text":"Recycled content"},{"text":"VOC emissions"},{"text":"Recyclability"},{"text":"Local availability"},{"text":"End-of-life potential"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 3 — Sustainable Interior Specialization","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is the key specialization year."},{"type":"h","text":"Sustainable materials"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Recycled materials"},{"text":"Reclaimed timber"},{"text":"Bamboo"},{"text":"Cork"},{"text":"Natural fibres"},{"text":"Low-emission paints"},{"text":"Low-VOC adhesives"},{"text":"Recycled metal"},{"text":"Recycled glass"},{"text":"Low-impact flooring"},{"text":"Bio-based materials"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Do not assume that a material is sustainable simply because it is marketed as \"natural\" or \"green.\" Evaluate its life cycle, sourcing, durability and disposal."},{"type":"h","text":"Indoor Environmental Quality"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Indoor Air Quality"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"VOCs"},{"text":"Formaldehyde"},{"text":"Ventilation"},{"text":"Filtration"},{"text":"Material emissions"},{"text":"Moisture control"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Thermal comfort"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Temperature"},{"text":"Humidity"},{"text":"Air movement"},{"text":"Occupant comfort"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Visual comfort"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Daylight"},{"text":"Glare"},{"text":"Artificial lighting"},{"text":"Colour rendering"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Acoustic comfort"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Reverberation"},{"text":"Sound absorption"},{"text":"Sound transmission"},{"text":"Privacy"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 4 — Professional Sustainability Consulting","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop the ability to evaluate complete interior projects."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Material specifications"},{"text":"Sustainable procurement"},{"text":"Life-cycle thinking"},{"text":"Embodied carbon"},{"text":"Operational energy"},{"text":"Lighting energy"},{"text":"Water efficiency"},{"text":"Waste management"},{"text":"Indoor air quality"},{"text":"Green-building documentation"},{"text":"Sustainability reports"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Client Requirements","Existing-Space Assessment","Sustainability Goals","Material + Energy Analysis","Design Development","Material Selection","Lighting + HVAC Coordination","Performance Evaluation","Sustainability Documentation","Implementation","Post-Occupancy Evaluation"]}]},{"heading":"Core Skill Matrix","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Target Level"],"rows":[[{"text":"Interior Architecture"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Space Planning"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Sustainable Design"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Building Materials"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Material Evaluation"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Indoor Air Quality"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Lighting"},{"text":"Intermediate–Advanced"}],[{"text":"Acoustics"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Thermal Comfort"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Building Physics"},{"text":"Intermediate–Advanced"}],[{"text":"Energy Efficiency"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Embodied Carbon"},{"text":"Intermediate–Advanced"}],[{"text":"Life-Cycle Thinking"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"BIM"},{"text":"Intermediate–Advanced"}],[{"text":"Revit"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"AutoCAD"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"SketchUp/Rhino"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Data Analysis"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Technical Reporting"},{"text":"Advanced"}]]}]},{"heading":"Software Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Design & BIM"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AutoCAD"},{"text":"Revit"},{"text":"SketchUp"},{"text":"Rhino"},{"text":"Grasshopper"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Visualization"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Enscape"},{"text":"Lumion or similar visualization tools"},{"text":"Photoshop"},{"text":"Illustrator"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Sustainability / Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn at least some combination of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Ladybug Tools"},{"text":"Honeybee"},{"text":"EnergyPlus"},{"text":"Climate Consultant"},{"text":"Whole-building or interior energy-analysis tools"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"Power BI"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The objective is not to collect software certificates. The objective is to be able to use software to justify design decisions with evidence."}]},{"heading":"Major Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Sustainable Residential Interior"},{"type":"p","text":"Design a residential interior with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Low-impact materials"},{"text":"Daylight optimization"},{"text":"Energy-efficient lighting"},{"text":"Natural ventilation strategy"},{"text":"Low-emission finishes"},{"text":"Water-efficient fixtures"},{"text":"Sustainable furniture"},{"text":"Compare the proposed design with a conventional baseline."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Sustainable Office Interior"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lighting energy"},{"text":"Daylight"},{"text":"HVAC loads"},{"text":"Workstation layout"},{"text":"Indoor air quality"},{"text":"Acoustic comfort"},{"text":"Material emissions"},{"text":"Create a sustainability scorecard."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Material Sustainability Database"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a database containing:"},{"type":"table","header":["Material","Embodied Carbon","VOC Risk","Recycled Content","Durability","Recyclability","Source"],"rows":[[{"text":"Flooring A"},{"text":"—"},{"text":"Manufacturer data"}],[{"text":"Flooring B"},{"text":"—"},{"text":"Manufacturer data"}],[{"text":"Paint A"},{"text":"—"},{"text":"Manufacturer data"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"This becomes a highly useful portfolio project if backed by real manufacturer/product documentation."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Circular Interior"},{"type":"p","text":"Design an interior around:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Reuse"},{"text":"Repair"},{"text":"Modular components"},{"text":"Demountable partitions"},{"text":"Reclaimed materials"},{"text":"Reusable furniture"},{"text":"Material recovery"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Concept:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Traditional Interior","Install","Use","Demolish","Waste"]},{"type":"flow","items":["Circular Interior","Design for Disassembly","Use","Repair / Reconfigure","Reuse","Recycle"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Sustainable Adaptive Reuse"},{"type":"p","text":"Take an existing building and redesign its interior rather than demolishing and rebuilding."},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Existing materials"},{"text":"Reuse potential"},{"text":"Energy performance"},{"text":"Daylight"},{"text":"Ventilation"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"New materials required"},{"text":"Construction waste avoided"},{"text":"This demonstrates both architectural and sustainability thinking."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 6 — Healthy Interior"},{"type":"p","text":"Design an interior focused on occupant wellbeing."},{"type":"p","text":"Evaluate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Indoor air quality"},{"text":"Material emissions"},{"text":"Daylight"},{"text":"Acoustic comfort"},{"text":"Thermal comfort"},{"text":"Biophilic elements"},{"text":"Lighting quality"}]}]},{"heading":"Internship Roadmap","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1–2"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Interior design studios"},{"text":"Architecture firms"},{"text":"Sustainable design studios"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Interior documentation"},{"text":"Material selection"},{"text":"Space planning"},{"text":"Interior detailing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2–3"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Green-building consultancies"},{"text":"Sustainability consultancies"},{"text":"Interior architecture firms"},{"text":"Material research companies"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Material assessment"},{"text":"Sustainable specifications"},{"text":"Indoor environmental quality"},{"text":"Green-building documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3–4"},{"type":"p","text":"Target specialized positions:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sustainability Intern"},{"text":"Sustainable Interior Design Intern"},{"text":"Green Building Intern"},{"text":"Building Performance Intern"},{"text":"Material Research Intern"},{"text":"Interior Architecture Intern"},{"text":"The best internship should expose the student to real sustainability analysis, not only interior rendering."}]}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Job Titles","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The exact title \"Sustainable Interior Consultant\" is not universal."},{"type":"p","text":"Search for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sustainability Consultant"},{"text":"Sustainable Design Consultant"},{"text":"Sustainable Interior Designer"},{"text":"Interior Sustainability Analyst"},{"text":"Green Building Consultant"},{"text":"Building Performance Analyst"},{"text":"Sustainability Analyst"},{"text":"Interior Design Consultant"},{"text":"Material Research Associate"},{"text":"Sustainable Materials Consultant"},{"text":"ESG / Built Environment Analyst"},{"text":"Green Building Coordinator"},{"text":"Sustainability Coordinator"}]}]},{"heading":"Employer Skill Matrix","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Employer Type","Important Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Interior Design Firm"},{"text":"Design + materials"}],[{"text":"Architecture Firm"},{"text":"BIM + sustainable design"}],[{"text":"Sustainability Consultancy"},{"text":"Building performance + certification"}],[{"text":"Green Building Consultancy"},{"text":"Documentation + standards"}],[{"text":"Real Estate Developer"},{"text":"Sustainability + project coordination"}],[{"text":"Corporate Workplace Consultancy"},{"text":"IEQ + materials + energy"}],[{"text":"Material Manufacturer"},{"text":"Material research + sustainability"}],[{"text":"Furniture Company"},{"text":"Circular design + material knowledge"}],[{"text":"Hospitality Design Firm"},{"text":"Sustainable interiors + procurement"}],[{"text":"ESG / Built Environment Consultancy"},{"text":"Carbon + sustainability analytics"}]]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Training","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Useful areas include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Green-building credentials"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"LEED"},{"text":"WELL"},{"text":"IGBC"},{"text":"GRIHA"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical training"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Building energy modelling"},{"text":"Indoor air quality"},{"text":"Life-cycle assessment"},{"text":"Embodied carbon"},{"text":"Sustainable materials"},{"text":"Circular design"},{"text":"Lighting design"},{"text":"Building performance"},{"text":"A certification can strengthen credibility, but it should complement real project experience and technical knowledge."}]}]},{"heading":"Higher Education Options","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A B.Arch is sufficient to begin working in sustainable interior design, but postgraduate study can help with specialized consulting and research."},{"type":"table","header":["PG Area","Relevance"],"rows":[[{"text":"M.Arch Sustainable Architecture"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"M.Arch Interior Architecture"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Sustainable Design"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Environmental Design"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Building Performance"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Building Science"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Energy & Environmental Design"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Interior Design"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Environmental Planning"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Sustainable Construction"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Arch","Interior Architecture","Sustainable Materials + Building Performance","Internship","Junior Sustainability / Interior Consultant","M.Arch / MSc Sustainable Design"]},{"type":"p","text":"OR"},{"type":"flow","items":["Industry Experience","Sustainable Interior Consultant"]},{"type":"p","text":"A PG is not mandatory for most entry-level roles, but advanced building-performance or research-oriented positions may benefit significantly from postgraduate specialization."}]},{"heading":"Specialization Paths","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Path A — Sustainable Materials Specialist"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Arch","Interior Architecture","Material Science","Life-Cycle Assessment","Embodied Carbon","Sustainable Materials Consultant"]},{"type":"p","text":"Best for candidates interested in materials and product evaluation."},{"type":"h","text":"Path B — Healthy Interior Specialist"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Arch","Interior Design","Indoor Air Quality","Lighting + Acoustics","Thermal Comfort","Healthy Building Consultant"]},{"type":"h","text":"Path C — Building Performance"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Arch","Interior Architecture","Building Physics","Energy Modelling","Daylight + Thermal Analysis","Building Performance Consultant"]},{"type":"h","text":"Path D — Circular Interior Design"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Arch","Interior Architecture","Circular Design","Design for Disassembly","Material Reuse","Circular Interior Consultant"]},{"type":"h","text":"Path E — Green Building Certification"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Arch","Sustainable Interior Design","LEED / WELL / IGBC / GRIHA Knowledge","Certification Documentation","Green Building Consultant","Sustainability Lead"]}]},{"heading":"Emerging Technologies","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"1. AI-Assisted Material Selection"},{"type":"p","text":"AI can assist in comparing materials based on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Environmental impact"},{"text":"Cost"},{"text":"Durability"},{"text":"Performance"},{"text":"Availability"},{"text":"Certifications"},{"text":"Human validation and reliable manufacturer/LCA data remain essential."}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Embodied Carbon Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Interior consultants increasingly need to evaluate:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Material Extraction","Manufacturing","Transportation","Installation","Use","End of Life"]},{"type":"p","text":"This is the basis of life-cycle thinking."},{"type":"h","text":"3. Digital Material Passports"},{"type":"p","text":"Future interiors may track materials digitally:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Material","Manufacturer Data","Environmental Data","Location in Building","Maintenance","Reuse / Recovery"]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Smart Building Integration"},{"type":"p","text":"Sustainable interiors increasingly interact with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sensors"},{"text":"Smart lighting"},{"text":"Occupancy detection"},{"text":"Indoor air-quality sensors"},{"text":"Automated shading"},{"text":"Building management systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Digital Twins"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Interior design data can increasingly connect with building operational data."},{"text":"BIM"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Interior Model"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"IoT"},{"text":"+"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["Building Data","Digital Twin","Performance Monitoring"]},{"type":"h","text":"6. AI + Generative Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Generative design can explore combinations of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Space planning"},{"text":"Daylight"},{"text":"Furniture"},{"text":"Materials"},{"text":"Thermal comfort"},{"text":"Energy use"},{"text":"The consultant's role shifts toward evaluating and validating design alternatives, rather than manually testing every option."}]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Minimum employability stack"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"B.Arch"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Interior Architecture"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Sustainable Design"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Material Knowledge"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Indoor Environmental Quality"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Thermal Comfort"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Lighting Fundamentals"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Revit"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"AutoCAD"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"SketchUp"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Green Building Fundamentals"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"3–4 Sustainability Projects"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Relevant Internship"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Strong candidate stack"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"B.Arch"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Interior Architecture"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Sustainable Materials"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Life-Cycle Thinking"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Embodied Carbon"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Indoor Air Quality"},{"text":"+"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["Thermal","Visual","Acoustic Comfort"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"+"},{"text":"Building Performance"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Revit"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Rhino / Grasshopper"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"EnergyPlus / Ladybug"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Excel + Python"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"LEED / WELL / IGBC Knowledge"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Real Sustainability Internship"}]}]},{"heading":"Target Profile by Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should be able to evaluate an interior from design, environmental and sustainability perspectives."},{"type":"flow","items":["Existing / Proposed Interior","Site + Climate Analysis","Space Planning","Material Assessment","Lighting Analysis","Thermal + Acoustic Considerations","Indoor Air Quality","Energy + Water Efficiency","Embodied Carbon","Sustainable Design Strategy","Technical Documentation","Implementation + Post-Occupancy Evaluation"]},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio target"},{"type":"p","text":"Build 5 strong projects:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sustainable residential interior"},{"text":"Sustainable office/workplace"},{"text":"Sustainable material comparison"},{"text":"Circular/adaptive-reuse interior"},{"text":"Healthy building interior"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Each project should demonstrate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design problem"},{"text":"Baseline condition"},{"text":"Sustainability objectives"},{"text":"Materials selected"},{"text":"Environmental analysis"},{"text":"Performance improvement"},{"text":"Technical drawings"},{"text":"Material specifications"},{"text":"Final design"}]}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest professional positioning is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Interior Architect","Building Sustainability","Material & Environmental Performance"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"rather than simply:"},{"type":"h","text":"Interior Designer who uses sustainable materials"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"The differentiator is the ability to connect design decisions with measurable environmental and occupant outcomes."},{"text":"Interior Architecture"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Sustainable Materials"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Building Performance"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Indoor Environmental Quality"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Carbon / Life-Cycle Thinking"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Green Building Standards"},{"text":"+"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["Digital Analysis","Sustainable Interior Consultant"]},{"type":"p","text":"This provides a strong progression toward Sustainable Interior Consultant → Senior Sustainability Consultant → Building/Interior Sustainability Lead, with adjacent opportunities in green-building certification, healthy buildings, sustainable materials, circular interiors, workplace sustainability and building-performance consulting."}]}]}